      "side": 1,
      "message": "Define it as a constant and comment it why pick a custom larger value, instead of PD_T_ERROR_RECOVERY.\n\nFurthermore, maybe you can change PD_T_ERROR_RECOVERY directly. For the case the PD partner goes to the ErrorRecovery state, Asurada may not detect the CC status change as the PD_T_ERROR_RECOVERY is too short.",
